  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Goety 与 Spillage</strong> 是一款实现 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goety\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goety</a> 与 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illage-and-spillage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illage &amp; Spillage</a>/<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illage-and-spillage-finally-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">Portage</a> 兼容的模组，让你能够使用后者模组中邪恶灾厄村民的特定法术与能力！<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/89800eb53001cf71e9190d71b3faf102ba0a8e6a_0.webp\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>推荐搭配：</strong></h5><p><strong>Undying 制作的 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/its-magispelling-time\" rel=\"nofollow\">It's Magispelling Time</a>，用于获取魔法施法者的能力。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord：</strong></h3><p>我的 Discord 服务器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/utQqkWUuDc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/utQqkWUuDc</a></p><h3><strong>捐赠支持：</strong></h3><p>欢迎请我喝杯咖啡：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/polarice3\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/polarice3</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>鸣谢</strong></h2><p><strong>- Yellowbross，Illage and Spillage 的创作者。</strong></p><p><strong>- TheDarkPeasant，Illage and Portage 的创作者。</strong></p>",
